    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Radioquacktive is a roguelike dungeon crawler where you control a duck who has been tasked to explore a post-apocalyptic world in hopes to find supplies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/be19a85040f9c13ceac2a1d5de30d9ae.poster.avif?t=1708905958\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/be19a85040f9c13ceac2a1d5de30d9ae.webm?t=1708905958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>In order to survive you will have to let go of your natural duck instincts and embrace the powers of nuclear radiation. Laser beak? Gorilla arm? Cybernetic Eyes? Anything is possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/d6af47f11cab8f785b7cef30ba4a6223.poster.avif?t=1708905958\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/d6af47f11cab8f785b7cef30ba4a6223.webm?t=1708905958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Tired of eating rotten, 15 year old food? Combine ingredients to create meals that will empower you during your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/6e09276872448466a4d85e2bb2c885b4.poster.avif?t=1708905958\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/6e09276872448466a4d85e2bb2c885b4.webm?t=1708905958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Achieve feats in the flooded wastelands to unlock new ways to explore, quack, and more.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Radioquacktive is a roguelike dungeon crawler where you control a duck who has been tasked to explore a post-apocalyptic world in hopes to find supplies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/be19a85040f9c13ceac2a1d5de30d9ae.poster.avif?t=1708905958\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/be19a85040f9c13ceac2a1d5de30d9ae.webm?t=1708905958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>In order to survive you will have to let go of your natural duck instincts and embrace the powers of nuclear radiation. Laser beak? Gorilla arm? Cybernetic Eyes? Anything is possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/d6af47f11cab8f785b7cef30ba4a6223.poster.avif?t=1708905958\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/d6af47f11cab8f785b7cef30ba4a6223.webm?t=1708905958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Tired of eating rotten, 15 year old food? Combine ingredients to create meals that will empower you during your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/6e09276872448466a4d85e2bb2c885b4.poster.avif?t=1708905958\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823600/extras/6e09276872448466a4d85e2bb2c885b4.webm?t=1708905958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Achieve feats in the flooded wastelands to unlock new ways to explore, quack, and more.",
